WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.873 --> 00:00:05.540
(ambient music)

00:00:06.726 --> 00:00:09.677
- The first one, there were
three people who came up.

00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:11.958
It was in a small room with the YMCA.

00:00:11.958 --> 00:00:13.539
And just kept doing it.

00:00:13.539 --> 00:00:15.963
And I know that some of
you guys have been here

00:00:15.963 --> 00:00:16.796
from the beginning.

00:00:16.796 --> 00:00:19.696
Remember when we had five,
eight people in the room?

00:00:19.696 --> 00:00:22.856
And as a result, now
we have over 80 people,

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.098
we're in Indigo.

00:00:24.098 --> 00:00:27.684
And it just shows that this
was just a part-time thing

00:00:27.684 --> 00:00:29.444
that I've been working on.

00:00:29.444 --> 00:00:30.753
Stick with whatever you're doing.

00:00:30.753 --> 00:00:32.423
Give it enough time.

00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:33.710
You're bound to succeed.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.268
And a lot of entrepreneurs quit too early.

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:37.684
They quit before they
reach the finish line.

00:00:37.684 --> 00:00:40.659
So I would encourage you to
stick with it, keep going.

00:00:40.659 --> 00:00:43.338
Eventually you'll get
to where you want to go.

00:00:43.338 --> 00:00:44.430
- On behalf of all of us,

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.665
thank you for the time you've
invested in the seminar.

00:00:46.665 --> 00:00:49.267
This is just a small token of appreciation

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:50.899
for love of learning.

00:00:50.899 --> 00:00:53.316
(applauding)

